Spoiler Alert (Now to see if I can embed a control-l)


	The secret doors are in the central left area of the screen.  Go
directly south of the stairway till you hit a wall, then go left till you
find a spot that can hide a door (you may have to go up a few times) then
search the area.  Open that door after unlocking, and search at the next
wall about two steps in, repeat.  There should be a pile of gems one being
the grey luck stone.  If you see two grey gem's, kick before picking up
or you could grab a load stone.


